SUMMARY: Crepe Paper Daffodil Flowers Workshop
DESCRIPTION:\nInstructor: Susan Crawford\nSunday\, August 9th\n11:00AM - 
 3:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$60\n\n\nJoin us to unlock your inner
  florist and create stunning crepe paper flowers.\n\nAll of us love to re
 ceive flowers but we hate to see them go. Join me while I instruct you to
  construct realistic crepe paper daffodil flowers. Make these elegant flo
 wers for someone special or as a treat for yourself. Each petal and leaf 
 are hand cut from artisanal Italian crepe paper and then assembled by han
 d.\n\nEnjoy a relaxed and creative atmosphere as you learn to create your
  own masterpiece. This beginner-friendly class is designed to open up you
 r imagination by learning basic techniques when using crepe paper as the 
 flower composition. All necessary supplies and tools will be provided. Ju
 st bring your inspired-artful love of flowers. Participants will take hom
