SUMMARY: Watercolor Fundamentals Part 2
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Anne Millett\n\nThis is a 6-class series\, meetin
 g 6 Tuesdays July 7th\, 14th\, 21st\, 28th\, August 4th & 11th\n2:00PM-4:
 30PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$270.00\n\nThere will be a materials fe
 e of $15 plus tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th classes priced
  separately\, August 18th & 25th\n\n\nWatercolor Fundamentals - Part 2\n\
 nThis next series will build on what we learned in Part 1\, quickly refre
 shing some techniques and then applying them in our paintings. We will cr
 eate more complex landscape paintings\, skies and seascapes\; wet-into-we
 t and wet-into-dry nature studies in a few different ways\, and we will v
 enture further into painting from our imaginations. We will explore abstr
 action and non-representational styles\, where we don't look at something
  and try to paint it\, but instead work intuitively with colors and shape
 s and let the paintings emerge and evolve from there. You don't have to k
 now where you're going\, enjoy the journey and see where it takes you!\n\
 nThis class is designed for adults 18+\n\nClass sizes are limited to 8 pe
 ople\, please register early\n\n$270 for 6 classes\, 2.5 hours each class
 \n\nThere will be a materials fee of $15 plus tax for the series.\n\n*opt
 ional 7th and 8th classes priced separately\nPayable via check\, cash\, o
 r Zelle.\n\n*Brushes\, palettes\, set-ups\, and paint will be provided.*\
 n\n\nTo see Anne's work and to learn more about this class\, please visit
  her website at: www.miraaster.com http://www.miraaster.com/\n\n\nTo regi
 ster for this workshop\, please contact Anne by email at: classes@miraast
 er.com mailto:classes@miraaster.com
