SUMMARY: Introduction to Inks Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Staff member\, Crash\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 22
 \n\nTime: 11am - 1pm\n\nLocation: San Rafael store\n\nFree Hands-On Works
 hop: Introduction to Inks\n\nDiscover the world of inks in this free\, ha
 nds-on workshop! Whether you’re new to inks or looking to explore techniq
 ues\, this workshop is an opportunity to experiment\, compare and get ins
 pired.\n\n\nWe’ll explore a variety of popular inks\, including Higgins\,
  FW\, Liquitex\, Ranger Ink\, and more and demonstrate their different ch
 aracteristics\, applications and creative possibilities. You’ll have a ch
 ance to get hands-on and see how these inks work with different technique
 s and surfaces.\n\nCome learn about the differences between inks\, discov
 er new ways to use them in your artwork\, and experiment with color\, lay
 ering\, blending and more.\n\nNo experience necessary-just bring your cur
 iosity and creativity!\n\nMaterials will be provided for this workshop.\n
 \n
CATEGORIES:San-Rafael,Inks,Technique,Free-Demo
