 r handmade papers\nstarting with an easy project progressing each month t
 o a more\nchallenging one.\n\nI will demonstrate techniques for making pa
 pers with\nand without the Gel-Plate. We will create a collection of cohe
 sive\npapers. The best of them you will use for your collage project of t
 he month.\n\nSome examples could be fish\, a butterfly\, a vase with flow
 ers\,\na grouping of various cups and more.\n\nStarting with the project 
 in February a requirement is that you\nare familiar and comfortable cutti
 ng shapes with an X-acto knife\nor a similar tool.\n\nTo register for thi
 s workshop\, please contact Magdalena at: 408.781.2589 or by email\nat: m
