SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nDate: Saturday\, September 19th\nTim
 e: 2:00PM-5:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFree: $40.00\n\nThis is 
 a hands-on make and take class where you will make at least five items in
 cluding a bookmark\, a greeting card\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. T
 he class will use two different techniques and Jan will explain how to pr
 ess flowers and which flowers hold their color best. It is a creative exp
 erience!\n\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Jan at: mail
 to:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com ma
 ilto:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from presse
 d flowers has been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal ar
 t training. She utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper
 \, each card uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: t
 he dining room table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxe
 s and trays of flowers. She buys card stock by the thousand and picks blo
 oms from her garden and other public places. Her family is used to me say
 ing\, “could we stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt
  is a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on i
 n the East facing parking lot while attending classes. We greatly appreci
 ate it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
