 00pm\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nPlease inquire in advance before droppi
 ng in.\n\nCome join us for a relaxing and fun morning of painting. In thi
 s open paint session you can explore your creativity and paint what inspi
 res you in your medium of choice. These open paint sessions are self guid
 ed. There is no formal instruction. This will be a laid back time to work
  at your own pace and converse with fellow artists\, getting feedback whe
 n desired.\n\nSpace is limited. To inquire about attending sessions\, ple
 ase contact Marg margstanko@hotmail.com mailto:margstanko@hotmail.com
