DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Magdalena Bogart\nDate: Monday\, October 5th\nTim
 e: 1:00PM-4:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nIn my ongo
 ing Gel-Printing & Collage workshop I want to offer you the opportunity t
 o collage with your handmade papers\, starting with an easy project progr
 essing each class to a more challenging one.\n\nI will demonstrate techni
 ques for making papers with and without the Gel-Plate. We will create a c
 ollection of cohesive\npapers. The best of them you will use for your col
 lage projects.\n\nSome examples are a fish\, a butterfly\, a vase with fl
 owers\, a grouping of various cups and more.\n\nOne requirement for this 
 class is that you are familiar and comfortable cutting shapes with an X-A
 cto knife or a similar tool.\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please co
 ntact Magdalena at: 408.781.2589 or by email\nat: mailto:mag.bogart@gmail
 .com mailto:mag.bogart@gmail.com mag.bogart@gmail.com mailto:mag.bogart@g
 mail.com
