SUMMARY: Watercolor Fundamentals Part 2
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Anne Millett\n\nDate: This is a 6-class series\, 
 meeting 6 Tuesdays September 15th\, 22nd\, 29th\, October 6th\, 13th & 20
 th.\nTime: 2:00PM-4:30PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $270.00\n\nThe
 re will be a materials fee of $20 plus tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7
 th and 8th classes priced separately\, October 27th & November 3rd.\n\n\n
 Watercolor Fundamentals - Part 2\n\nThis next series will build on what w
 e learned in Part 1\, quickly refreshing some techniques and then applyin
 g them in our paintings. We will create more complex landscape paintings\
 , skies and seascapes\; wet-into-wet and wet-into-dry nature studies in a
  few different ways\, and we will venture further into painting from our 
 imaginations. We will explore abstraction and non-representational styles
 \, where we don't look at something and try to paint it\, but instead wor
 k intuitively with colors and shapes and let the paintings emerge and evo
 lve from there. You don't have to know where you're going\, enjoy the jou
 rney and see where it takes you!\n\nThis class is designed for adults 18+
 \n\nClass sizes are limited to 8 people\, please register early\n\n$270 f
 or 6 classes\, 2.5 hours each class\n\nThere will be a materials fee of $
 20 plus tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th classes priced separ
 ately\nPayable via check\, cash\, or Zelle.\n\n*Brushes\, palettes\, set-
 ups\, and paint will be provided.*\n\n\nTo see Anne's work and to learn m
 ore about this class\, please visit her website at: www.miraaster.com htt
 p://www.miraaster.com/\n\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contac
 t Anne by email at: classes@miraaster.com mailto:classes@miraaster.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
