SUMMARY: Crepe Paper Eucalyptus Workshop
DESCRIPTION:\nInstructor: Susan Crawford\nDate: Saturday\, October 10th\n
 Time: 11:00AM - 3:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $60\n\n\nJoin us
  to unlock your inner florist and create stunning crepe paper flowers.\n\
 nAll of us love to receive flowers but we hate to see them go. Join me wh
 ile I instruct you to construct realistic crepe paper eucalyptus. Make th
 ese beautiful flowers for someone special or as a treat for yourself. Eac
 h petal and leaf are hand cut from artisanal Italian crepe paper and then
  assembled by hand.\n\nEnjoy a relaxed and creative atmosphere as you lea
 rn to create your own masterpiece. This beginner-friendly class is design
 ed to open up your imagination by learning basic techniques when using cr
 epe paper as the flower composition. All necessary supplies and tools wil
 l be provided. Just bring your inspired-artful love of flowers. Participa
 nts will take home their finished bouquets.\n\nTo register: please email 
 mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com Crawfor
 dsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com
