SUMMARY: Take the art of Still Life to new places
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Sandra Novia\n\nDates: This is a 6-class series\,
  meeting 6 Fridays: September 18th\, 25th\, October 2nd\, 9th\, 16th & 23
 rd.\n\nTime: 2:30pm - 4:30pm.\n\nLocation : Santa Rosa Store\n\nFee: $310
  for 6 classes.\n\nThis class is an ongoing series. You can register and 
 start at anytime. Please contact instructor for more details.\n\nThis cla
 ss is for art explorers of all levels!\n\nCreating a still life is about 
 waking up your observational skills. Moving through different mediums\, w
 e will embark on a journey together\, exploring how to apply many art for
 ms and techniques to express what you see in life.\n\nIn this six week co
 urse\, each class will explore a different art medium. We will draw and p
 aint with graphite\, watercolor pencils and acrylic. We will expand on th
 ose mediums as we move into printmaking\, collage\, and mosaic to bring y
 our art to life. It's a great class to learn the fundamentals for beginne
 rs and for experienced artists that want to try their hand at a new art f
 orm you haven't done before.\n\nAll levels Welcomed.\n\nLet's explore the
  beautiful art of expressing Art together.\n\n\nTo register for this seri
 es\, please contact Sandra Novia at: (707) 433-ARTS (2787)\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Mixed-Media
