SUMMARY: Crepe Paper Poinsettias Workshop
DESCRIPTION:\nInstructor: Susan Crawford\nDate: Saturday\, November 7th\n
 Time: 10:00AM - 2:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $60\n\n\nJoin us
  to unlock your inner florist and create stunning crepe paper flowers.\n\
 nAll of us love to receive flowers but we hate to see them go. Join me wh
 ile I instruct you to construct realistic crepe paper Poinsettias. Make t
 hese beautiful flowers for someone special or as a treat for yourself. Ea
 ch petal and leaf are hand cut from artisanal Italian crepe paper and the
 n assembled by hand.\n\nEnjoy a relaxed and creative atmosphere as you le
 arn to create your own masterpiece. This beginner-friendly class is desig
 ned to open up your imagination by learning basic techniques when using c
 repe paper as the flower composition. All necessary supplies and tools wi
 ll be provided. Just bring your inspired-artful love of flowers. Particip
 ants will take home their finished bouquets.\n\nTo register: please email
  mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com Crawfo
 rdsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com
