SUMMARY: Introduction to SoulCollage
DESCRIPTION:\nPresenter: Karen Haas\nSunday\, November 8th\n1:00PM-3:30PM
 \n$25.00 (Includes All Supplies)\nLocation: Santa Rosa\n\nSoulCollage® is
  part creative exploration and part self-discovery. It’s fun and can be d
 elightfully surprising! Participants will explore the process of collage 
 making using magazines images on 5” x 8” canvas\, usually cut from mat bo
 ard or other stiff paper. Collage allows everyone to be an artist\, even 
 if you don’t believe you have a creative bone in your body\, because you 
 are working with found images. In this Introductory class you will also e
 xplore the intuitive process of "listening" to the wisdom of the collage 
 you completed\, using images that you were drawn to. If one decides to ke
 ep making these 5”x 8” cards\, you eventually have your own personally ma
 de oracle deck that can offer you insights and guidance from deep soul wi
 sdom.\n\nYou’ll then learn how to “read” your card as it\nshares its deep
 er meaning\, offering insights and guidance. www.artofpresence.net http:/
 /www.artofpresence.net/\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact
  Karen at: 707-494-2205 by call or text\nor please email her at: karen@ar
 tofpresence.net mailto:karen@artofpresence.net\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Collage
